          <ownedTools xsi:type="tool:EdgeCreationDescription" name="Alternative" edgeMappings="//@ownedViewpoints[name='Product%20Variant%20Viewpoint']/@ownedRepresentations[name='Feature%20Model']/@additionalLayers[name='Model%20Layer']/@edgeMappings[name='Alternative']">
            <sourceVariable name="source"/>
            <targetVariable name="target"/>
